## Aper-Oculus (APT-KRIA-FMC Rev 1.00) master constraints, Kria K26C/K26I SOM
## GENERATED by tools/gen_board_files.py. Uncomment the lines you use and rename ports to match your design.
## Port names match the board-file pin names, so board-interface designs and RTL designs share one naming.
##
## Bank supplies:
##   Bank 43  HDB  VADJ_FMC  1.8 V  FMC LA30, LA32, LA33 (single-ended only)
##   Bank 44  HDC  PL_3V3    3.3 V  IMU, barometer, fan, camera resets, alerts
##   Bank 45  HDA  PL_3V3    3.3 V  Camera 0 GPIO, DP power switch, SOM power alert
##   Bank 64  HPC  VADJ_FMC  1.8 V  FMC LA18, LA21-LA29, LA31, CLK0_M2C; SLVS-EC control
##   Bank 65  HPB  VADJ_FMC  1.8 V  FMC LA00-LA17 + LA19/LA20, CLK1_M2C
##   Bank 66  HPA  PL_1V2    1.2 V  MIPI cameras, 200 MHz oscillator
##   Bank 224 GTH  SOM       n/a    GTH quad: FMC DP0-DP3, SLVS-EC lanes, 2 refclks

